{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "HaeTae: Guardians",
    "steam_appid": 2854210,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/d3294eb3445725c23aba9bed9d2053a4.avif?t=1754889445\" width=1290 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Haetae: Guardians&gt;</strong>\u00a0is a fantasy action-adventure game set in the Joseon Dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Four Guardian Beasts, who once protected the land from evil spirits, have gone astray. As their power fades, monsters begin to appear across Joseon, bringing chaos to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of the crisis, the protagonist is chosen by the Yellow Dragon and sets off on a journey with Haetae, the mythical beast, to purify the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the corrupted guardians and the hidden secrets that led to the disaster in this epic tale of purification and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haetae: Guardians offers intuitive and simple controls, making the action accessible yet deeply engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge with generous timing windows and immerse yourself in the game's tense, challenging combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haetae\u2019s skills possess purifying power. When used effectively against bosses and elite monsters, they can put enemies into a stunned (groggy) state after dealing enough damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique action and strategic gameplay using both the protagonist and Haetae. Each character can be developed in different ways, allowing for various build combinations and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2854210/extras/d3294eb3445725c23aba9bed9d2053a4.avif?t=1754889445\" width=1290 height=180 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&lt;Haetae: Guardians&gt;</strong>\u00a0is a fantasy action-adventure game set in the Joseon Dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Four Guardian Beasts, who once protected the land from evil spirits, have gone astray. As their power fades, monsters begin to appear across Joseon, bringing chaos to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the midst of the crisis, the protagonist is chosen by the Yellow Dragon and sets off on a journey with Haetae, the mythical beast, to purify the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the truth behind the corrupted guardians and the hidden secrets that led to the disaster in this epic tale of purification and redemption.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haetae: Guardians offers intuitive and simple controls, making the action accessible yet deeply engaging.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge with generous timing windows and immerse yourself in the game's tense, challenging combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haetae\u2019s skills possess purifying power. When used effectively against bosses and elite monsters, they can put enemies into a stunned (groggy) state after dealing enough damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience unique action and strategic gameplay using both the protagonist and Haetae. Each character can be developed in different ways, allowing for various build combinations and playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Become the prince chosen by the Yellow Dragon and save Joseon with Haetae. Experience intense battles with simple controls. Use the East Asian divine beast Haetae to unleash skills and ultimate abilities. Strategize synergies through loot and develop your character your way.",
